// Signing, kept out of project.yml so the repo stays clone-and-run.
//
// It lives in a folder rather than at the repo root so XcodeGen can give it a
// deterministic id — see the note above `configFiles` in project.yml.
//
// A clone with no Apple account gets no DEVELOPMENT_TEAM and builds for the
// simulator, which needs no signing. To install on a real device, create an
// untracked Config/Local.xcconfig next to this file containing your own team:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = XXXXXXXXXX
//
// `#include?` is the OPTIONAL form: when Local.xcconfig is absent Xcode carries
// on silently, which is what keeps a fresh clone building.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
